# Morrowmake 1.0.0 .env for the configuration of this repository (append to the release's .env).
# Everything not set here keeps the release default: 0.95 memory utilisation, DSpark on, 262,144-token context,
# 8 concurrent requests, Engram tables in RAM when the host has room (auto).

# Where the three checkpoints live (export with layers 18-22 grafted, official, hybrid); see docs/setup.md, step 3.
# MODELS_DIR=./models-k3

# Lossless compact KV cache (needs kvc-overlay/ and start.sh.patch).
VLLM_SM80_COMPACT_KV=1

# Exposed API: listen address, port, served name and a key. /health stays open.
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8011
SERVED_MODEL_NAME=deepseek-v4.1-flash
API_KEY=change-me

# Without DSpark (larger KV pool, slower single stream): see start-nospec.sh, or uncomment
# EXTRA_ARGS=--speculative-config null
# Longer context (measured up to 1,000,000 tokens, see docs/results.md): add --max-model-len 1048576 to EXTRA_ARGS.
